    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0055_10808d0ac1c2.png\"><br>\n$\\begin{aligned} & A B=h \\sec r \\\\ & B C=h \\sec r \\sin (\\bar{i}-r) \\\\ & B C=\\frac{h \\sin (i-r)}{\\cos r}\\end{aligned}$"
